        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "p3s1",
            "text": "In China, chopsticks and good luck are connected."
          },
          {
            "id": "p3s2",
            "text": "So on the Chinese New Year’s Eve, many families will lay out new chopsticks as a way of asking for good luck."
          }
        ]
